   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p><strong data-end=\"2357\" data-start=\"2128\">Explain Peterson&rsquo;s solution for mutual exclusion. How does it work, and how does it meet the requirements of the critical section problem? Also explain how hardware instructions like Test-and-Set help achieve synchronization.</strong></p>\n",
